OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMajor fire at Canada military base
OL,4,Aleaves four dead, dozens injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire broke out at about 16:00 local
OL,7,Ftime (22:00 GMT) on Saturday at
OL,8,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, one of
OL,9,Fthe country's busiest military training
OL,10,Fbases, and is now contained. Its cause
OL,11,Fis still unclear, but officials said it
OL,12,Fdid not appear tied to "terrorist
OL,13,Factivity".
OL,15,F"The nation is in mourning for those
OL,16,Fbrave members of our armed forces who
OL,17,Fwe have lost," said Carney.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
