OL,3,ATrump says suspension of Russia
OL,4,Asanctions is to keep peace negotiations
OL,5,Agoing
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump blocked numerous sanctions on
OL,8,FRussia on Friday night, two days before
OL,9,Fthey were due to take effect, as a row
OL,10,Fwith Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,11,FZelensky deepened.
OL,13,FZelensky told NBC News on Sunday that
OL,14,Fsiding with Russian President Vladimir
OL,15,FPutin would be a "historic mistake".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
